{"parse":{"title":"Prayers for the Forest","pageid":395616,"revid":2035127,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Prayers for the Forest</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1d/Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024350\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Prayers for the Forest\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1d/Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024350\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1d/Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024350 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1d/Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024350 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Prayers for the Forest\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Prayers for the Forest.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Displays the location of nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Nod-Krai_Local_Specialty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nod-Krai Local Specialty\">resources unique to Nod-Krai</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Mini-map\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mini-map\">mini-map</a>.<br />Additionally, Lauma appears to have a special affinity with some small animals affected by <a href=\"/wiki/Kuuvahki\" title=\"Kuuvahki\">kuuvahki</a>...</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Resource\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resource\">Resource</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Local_Specialty\" title=\"Local Specialty\">Local Specialty</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nod-Krai_Local_Specialty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nod-Krai Local Specialty\">Nod-Krai Local Specialty</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wildlife\" title=\"Wildlife\">Wildlife</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Other_Wildlife\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Other Wildlife\">Other Wildlife</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Prayers for the Forest</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Preview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Preview</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPrayers_for_the_Forest%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Lauma must be in the active party for Prayers for the Forest to take effect.\n<ul><li>She does not need to be alive to locate local specialties, but does need to be alive to enable the passive's wildlife-related effects.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Only one local specialty will be shown on the mini-map at a time.</li>\n<li>Certain <a href=\"/wiki/Wildlife\" title=\"Wildlife\">wildlife</a> will behave differently if Lauma is in the party. This only applies in Nod-Krai, and will not work on the same creatures in other <a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">regions</a>.\n<ul><li>Some creatures will have special interactions. A glowing <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Frostmoon Scions\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Frostmoon Scions.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Frostmoon_Scions.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/e/e9/Icon_Dialogue_Frostmoon_Scions.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250911080920\" /></span></span> symbol will briefly appear above them when approached.\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Blunthorn_Rhino\" title=\"Blunthorn Rhino\">Blunthorn Rhino</a> - These mine and retrieve nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Rainbowdrop_Crystal\" title=\"Rainbowdrop Crystal\">Rainbowdrop Crystals</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Chic_Badger\" title=\"Chic Badger\">Chic Badger</a> - These dig up <a href=\"/wiki/Fowl\" title=\"Fowl\">Fowl</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Raw_Meat\" title=\"Raw Meat\">Raw Meat</a> (amount varies).</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Puffin\" title=\"Puffin\">Puffin</a> - These follow the party around.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rimehorn_Deer\" title=\"Rimehorn Deer\">Rimehorn Deer</a> - These heal the party and fully fill their <a href=\"/wiki/Energy\" title=\"Energy\">Energy</a> meters.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Wildlife in the \"<a href=\"/wiki/Wildlife#Other\" title=\"Wildlife\">Other</a>\" category will not <a href=\"/wiki/Startle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Startle\">startle</a> when approached.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pale-Furred_Wolf\" title=\"Pale-Furred Wolf\">Pale-Furred Wolves</a> will not attack when approached. However, they will do so if the player enters combat or stays near them for more than a few minutes.</li>\n<li>Unlocks exclusive dialogue with certain <a href=\"/wiki/Animal_NPCs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animal NPCs\">animal NPCs</a>, such as <a href=\"/wiki/Pavlov\" title=\"Pavlov\">Pavlov</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Speranza#Lucky_Spin!\" title=\"Speranza\">Lucky Spin</a> minigame, the <a href=\"/wiki/Finches\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Finches\">finch</a> beside <a href=\"/wiki/Richeza\" title=\"Richeza\">Richeza</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Vesnici_Proleca_Greenhouse\" title=\"Vesnici Proleca Greenhouse\">Vesnici Proleca Greenhouse</a>, and the guard animals near <a href=\"/wiki/Lyylikki\" title=\"Lyylikki\">Lyylikki</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The following <a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a> are similar to this talent:\n<ul><li>Nod-Krai Local Specialty:\n<ul><li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Light_in_the_Dark\" title=\"A Light in the Dark\"><img alt=\"A Light in the Dark\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent A Light in the Dark.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_A_Light_in_the_Dark.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_A_Light_in_the_Dark.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250912030126\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Light_in_the_Dark\" title=\"A Light in the Dark\"><img alt=\"A Light in the Dark\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent A Light in the Dark.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_A_Light_in_the_Dark.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_A_Light_in_the_Dark.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250912030126\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/A_Light_in_the_Dark\" title=\"A Light in the Dark\">A Light in the Dark</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Flins\" title=\"Flins\">Flins</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor\" title=\"Miniaturized Detection Sensor\"><img alt=\"Miniaturized Detection Sensor\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Miniaturized Detection Sensor.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/35/Talent_Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250910024358\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor\" title=\"Miniaturized Detection Sensor\"><img alt=\"Miniaturized Detection Sensor\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Miniaturized Detection Sensor.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/35/Talent_Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250910024358\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor\" title=\"Miniaturized Detection Sensor\">Miniaturized Detection Sensor</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Aino\" title=\"Aino\">Aino</a>)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Other Wildlife:\n<ul><li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tailing_on_Tiptoes\" title=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\"><img alt=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Tailing on Tiptoes.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Tailing_on_Tiptoes.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/89/Talent_Tailing_on_Tiptoes.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20230118020529\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tailing_on_Tiptoes\" title=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\"><img alt=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Tailing on Tiptoes.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Tailing_on_Tiptoes.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/8/89/Talent_Tailing_on_Tiptoes.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20230118020529\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Tailing_on_Tiptoes\" title=\"Tailing on Tiptoes\">Tailing on Tiptoes</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Yaoyao\" title=\"Yaoyao\">Yaoyao</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thought_and_Intent,_Like_Silken_Scent\" title=\"Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent\"><img alt=\"Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Thought_and_Intent%2C_Like_Silken_Scent.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/11/Talent_Thought_and_Intent%2C_Like_Silken_Scent.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250121102239\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thought_and_Intent,_Like_Silken_Scent\" title=\"Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent\"><img alt=\"Thought and Intent, Like Silken Scent\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEA